Source: alx-link
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Algothix OS Maintainers <maintainers@algothix.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://algothix.com

Package: alx-link
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, openssh-client, rsync, tmux, mosh, syncthing, xclip, libnotify-bin, wireguard-tools
Suggests: tailscale
Description: Lightweight cross-device workspace layer for Algothix OS (ALX) Lite
 Pairs Algothix OS machines using a one-time PIN confirmation code over
 Tailscale (default) or WireGuard, configuring SSH keys, Syncthing (~/ALX-Sync
 at idle I/O priority, enabled only after pairing), Taildrop or scp/rsync file
 send, xclip clipboard push, notify-send alerts, and remote tmux builds.
